{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261qqDwehAiD1794211189.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港投公司行政總裁陳家齊表示，作為政府的耐心資本，致力投資生物科技，人工智能(AI)及硬科技等高增長企業，促進跨界別協同效應，整體投資組合錄得穩健回報。</p><p></p><p>港投公司行政總裁陳家齊表示：「我們傾向投資早期及成長期企業，扶持它們成長並共同建立成功，因此我們超過七成的資金中均投放早期及成長期企業。雖然港投公司自2022年10月成立至今，歷史相對較短，但截至2025年，我們的投資組合自成立以來的淨內部回報率達到百分之14。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.141995+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T07:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:42.701266+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:31.543140+00:00","content_hash":"cf7b861b37f4ddae140a88fecae8a43f87b03f52045d293bfa12d5f5c109577d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.141995+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}